$NetBSD$

/lib           contains the native (.so) libraries of LWJGL 2.
/share/lwjgl2  contains modified versions of the Java libraries.

The modified JARs are responsible for loading the natives and recognizing
NetBSD correctly, and must be linked against by dependent Java programs,
replacing generic upstream releases of the LWJGL 2 JARs.

This package hosts the jMonkeyEngine "maintained" fork of LWJGL 2, which is
binary-compatible with programs expecting 2.9.3 or 2.9.4-nightly.
